        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-04T08:32:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We've always just...fought her as normal. I can imagine she's much more difficult when H = &gt;3 though, at least on her flip side (off the top of my head, I seem to recall that all the Projections deal fixed amounts of damage rather than being H-based), due to all the extra cards she plays (plus the direct damage she deals).</p>",
