        "created_at": "2014-04-04T08:35:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You could give her a Bomber Blade-esque timer on her front side, so destroyed Projections go under her and hurt you... but again, Bladey. You could always try skipping her front side and starting on the back?</p>",
