        "username": "zamielvanweber",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/z/d2c977/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-04T18:14:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That is... tricky. Aside from some sort of gentleman's agreement not to, I would recommend making it so that if she has to draw a card and cannot, the heroes lose. Think of it as the sleeping child has simply accumulated TOO MUCH psychic energy and died. The flip side would not have the restriction, since her direct mental attacks are bleeding off psychic energy.</p>",
