      {
        "id": 98622,
        "name": "Ironic",
        "username": "Ironic",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ironic/{size}/2171_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-04T18:48:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That's innovative, Zamielvanweber, but avergates out to around a 15-turn timer when&nbsp;<em>H</em>=4, which is very merciful. &nbsp;It would limit the worst abuse, but hardly all of it.</p><p>I had considered starting on the flip side, but that seems (1) too harsh even for me, and (2) like it would lose the drama of racing to reach Young Vanessa... then getting there and things getting even worse. &nbsp;My biggest problem with Bomber Blade (and regular Blade, to be honest) was always that once you won the race on side 1, side 2 was anticlimactic, so I like the potential of The Dreamer to invert that, but sadly, as printed, they forgot to include the race.</p>",
